              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Morodekai yaaruga omu maisho g'omugabe, yaashohora ajwaire bushuuti y'omugabe eya bururu kandi erikwera, ajwaire ekirunga kihango ky'ezaabu, kandi anagiire omunagiro gwa bafuta na bujwa; batyo ab'omu rurembo Shushani baateera akaari baashemererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
